#: ruleswidget.cpp:638
msgid ""
"You have specified the window class as unimportant.\n"
"This means the settings will possibly apply to windows from all "
"applications. If you really want to create a generic setting, it is "
"recommended you at least limit the window types to avoid special window "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Naveli ste da je klasa prozora nevažna.\n"
"Ovo znači da bi se postavke mogle primjenjivati na prozore svih aplikacija. "
"Ako stvarno želite promijeniti opšte postavke, preporučujemo da, ako "
"ništa drugo, ograničite tipove prozora kako ne biste uticali na posebne "
"tipove."

